# 네이버가 실제로 돌려준 VEVENT 원문 (CalDAV GET). 파서 테스트의 정답 데이터로 쓸 것.
# 1) 종일 + 매년 반복 + 알람 2개 + 스티커/색상 (PRODID가 구 Works Mobile)
BEGIN:VCALENDAR
PRODID:Works Mobile Calendar
VERSION:2.0
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20190107T083401Z
UID:82473eea...@naver.com_caldavApp
X-NAVER-REGISTERER;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;X-WORKSMOBILE-WID=someid:1790037450831
X-NAVER-LAST-MODIFIER;X-WORKSMOBILE-WID=so*****@naver.com;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL:1790037450831
CREATED:20190107T083257Z
X-NAVER-ANNIVERSARY:
PRIORITY:0
X-NAVER-STICKER;X-WORKSMOBILE-POS=0:506
LAST-MODIFIED:20190107T083310Z
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;INTERVAL=1;BYMONTH=5;BYMONTHDAY=15
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20190515
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20190516
SUMMARY:someone 생일
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-NAVER-CATEGORY-ID:75671111
X-NAVER-CATEGORY-COLOR:7
DESCRIPTION:
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
TRIGGER:-PT12H
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
TRIGGER:-PT156H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR

# 2) 시각 일정 + VTIMEZONE 동봉 + 반복 + 예외 회차(EXDATE / RECURRENCE-ID)
#    하나의 VCALENDAR 안에 VEVENT가 둘이다. 두 번째는 같은 UID + RECURRENCE-ID를 가진 "예외 회차"이므로
#    별개 일정으로 세면 안 된다.
BEGIN:VCALENDAR
PRODID:Naver Calendar
VERSION:2.0
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
BEGIN:VTIMEZONE
TZID:Asia/Seoul
TZURL:http://tzurl.org/zoneinfo-outlook/Asia/Seoul
X-LIC-LOCATION:Asia/Seoul
BEGIN:STANDARD
TZOFFSETFROM:+0900
TZOFFSETTO:+0900
TZNAME:Korean Standard Time
DTSTART:19700101T000000
END:STANDARD
END:VTIMEZONE
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:주간 미팅
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Seoul:20260926T190000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Seoul:20260926T210000
DTSTAMP:20260921T234810Z
LOCATION:
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;UNTIL=20261107T100000Z;INTERVAL=1;BYDAY=SA
UID:-5f-6a-8c163a...@naver.com_caldavApp
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:
PRIORITY:0
X-NAVER-STICKER;X-WORKSMOBILE-POS=0:501
X-NAVER-REGISTERER;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;X-WORKSMOBILE-WID=someid:1790037450838
CREATED:20260921T234810Z
EXDATE;TZID=Asia/Seoul:20260926T190000
SEQUENCE:2
LAST-MODIFIED:20260922T002756Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-NAVER-CATEGORY-COLOR:12
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20260922T001026Z
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=Asia/Seoul:20260926T190000
UID:-5f-6a-8c163a...@naver.com_caldavApp
CREATED:20260922T001020Z
SUMMARY:주간 미팅
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Seoul:20260922T230000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Seoul:20260922T235900
LOCATION:
CLASS:PUBLIC
X-NAVER-STICKER;X-WORKSMOBILE-POS=1:501
DESCRIPTION:
PRIORITY:0
SEQUENCE:2
LAST-MODIFIED:20260922T001026Z
X-NAVER-CATEGORY-COLOR:12
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
